# Aeric Ryder — Backstory & Memory Splinters

Full author canon: `@mc_sheet.md` → **Pre-Day Zero — Author Canon**. Never wiki-dump; splinters only.

## Locked canon (summary)

**Maria Ryder (mother)** — cancer; died when Aeric was **3**. Was **~28–30** (same age Aeric is now). Closer than close; memory stuck. Growing up he **spoke to her ghost** — others thought crazy or messing around. Occasional one-line internal *Mum* / *Maria* in prose OK; **no** Act I séance scenes; **do not** confirm supernatural yet.

**Wade Ryder (father)** — **34 years older** (~early 60s Day Zero). Single dad. Aeric **loves him**. **Animal** — forced **BJJ from age 5**, forced **compete**. Wade’s **motorcycle accident** → Aeric **never trained again**. Survival **unknown** Day Zero. **Later character maybe** — do not introduce until earned.

**Cohen** — best friend from school; **stayed close**. Survival unknown Day Zero.

**BJJ black belt** — could’ve been prodigy; **rusted** since accident. **Primary** fight-memory rhymes (frames, grips, mount, escapes). Rugby = secondary (hated compulsory PE).

## When to use past (Act I)

**Yes — 1–2 lines, inside the action, then survival:**

* Clinch / pin / ground / choke line → **BJJ** (*Wade’s voice. Hip escape. Don’t give your back.*)
* Sloppy pile / mud tackle → **rugby** (hated it; worse now)
* Bus wreckage / metal in loam → commute, office
* Slow death / hospital smell → **Maria** (rare, sharp)
* Get up / don’t quit → **Wade** (*Is he alive? Move.*)
* Horrific absurdity → **Cohen** (*You’d never believe this. You alive?*)
* One beat to the dead → *Maria—* / *Mum—* then cut

**No:**

* Full flashback scenes (Act I).
* Explaining backstory to Mariusz or the reader unprompted.
* Melodrama every time someone dies.
* Wade or Cohen on-page reunion without author gate.
* Confirming Maria’s ghost is real in narration.

## Format

* Deep third limited; Zack-style internal voice.
* Splinter mid-beat — not a paragraph pause before action resumes.
* Discovery POV unchanged.

## Environment splinters

* Wrong scale, buried metal, Aether pockets — survival-tied; Aeric misreads. No wiki dumps.

